ation results in\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\lambda -7)^{2} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand so $\\lambda =7$ is a repeated root of the auxiliary equation." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-130130/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f5fb4d6b-2c86-5ad6-898b-5a1cd44e4106"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-130130"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-130133/selection/234203949c30ec11eab36a0336b8fbdf69149d495c9a3e6e34606ec3f76b8d92" :answer/id #uuid "ee27f467-a18b-5301-9690-e5d96c28c11c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$-5$ or $5$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130133/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "b4611293-48fc-59e1-ad0a-823f007eaf5d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130133/selection/5e1e7d9e80056d5a81436ed0484c9ad596c297f55c9a59464af66b0f7c33530a" :answer/id #uuid "c1f6a842-0eae-5302-933e-2c9404933c70" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$-10$ or $10$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130133/selection/5d022a88a643e97abec4d01dfce48411101475c0705a98f29f3a8e3560fb0616" :answer/id #uuid "fb012392-df3f-548a-8ff8-98c659db6e63" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130133/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "1b0a709a-1969-5ee1-8f4d-5d76578afc1a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-130133/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "b0b30e89-c4be-5e21-8828-f82a450d9bac" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-130133/selection/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer-field/choices ["q-130133/selection/234203949c30ec11eab36a0336b8fbdf69149d495c9a3e6e34606ec3f76b8d92" "q-130133